{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bomb Around\u00a0...and find out!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">is a platforming challenge where you play as a bomb whose sole purpose is to reach as high as possible. This is an explosive journey to compete in 3 different game modes: SpeedRun, Daily Seed and Regular play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Explode your way to the top.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">but be careful, the more you explode, the less platforms there are to catch you when you fall!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Charge your explosion for bigger jumps.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This simple to learn, hard to master mechanic, combined with the freedom to aim with your mouse will surely challenge you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Unique upgrades:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up upgrades on your journey that will aid you\u00a0in reaching new heights!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>3 Different GameModes:</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Normal: for those who want to explore and have fun without extra pressure, but still a chance for recognition via the leaderboard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> SpeeRun: try to reach a certain height as quickly as possible to get a place on the leaderboard. (seed based)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Daily seed: compete to reach as high as possible in a mode that changes seed once every 24hr.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539690?t=1740688557","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740688557","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539690/0e1e8